files.description:
users.csv: contains general information about the participants, and the results of the understandability task: 
- Id: automatic generated identifier;
- AGGREGATION: between-subject condition assigned to the participant, describing the aggregation strategy used in the scenarios the user evaluated (APP: "Approval Voting", MAJ: "Majority", ADD: "Additive", LMS: "Least Misery", MPL: Most Pleasure", or FAI: "Fairness"); 
- EXPLANATION: between-subject condition assigned to the participant, describing the explanation strategy used in the scenarios the user evaluated  ("NO_EXP": "No Explanation", "EXP": "Basic Explanation"); 
- Start_time: Timestamp for the start of the experiment; 
- End_time: Timestamp for the end of the experiment; 
- Age_group: age group of the participant (1: "8-25", 2: "26-35", 3: "36-45", 4: "46-55", 5: ">55", 6: "prefer not to say"); 
- Gender: self-identified gender of the participant (1: "male", 2: "female", 3: "other", 4: "prefer not to say"); 
- Underst_start_timestamp: Timestamp for the start of the understandability task; 
- Underst_system_choice: User prediction of the system choice for the given aggregation strategy, for the understandability task;
- Underst_system_choice_feedback: feedback provided for the system choice, for the understandability task;
- Underst_best_choice: User recommendation of the best choice for the group, for the understandability task;
- Underst_best_feedback: feedback provided for the best choice, for the understandability task;
- Underst_end_timestamp: Timestamp for the end of the understandability task; 
- General_feedback: general feedback provided at the end of the experiment;
- Total_time: Total time spent on the experiment, in seconds;
- Underst_system_correct: Correct choice for the system prediction, for the understandability task;
- Correct_prediction: Binary variable, 1 if the user correctly indicated the system recommendation (Underst_system_choice==Underst_system_correct), 0 otherwise.

